15.1 Entire Agreement.
This license, together with the OpenHours Terms of Service and Privacy
Policy as in effect from time to time, is the entire agreement between
You and OpenHours regarding the Software and supersedes any prior or
contemporaneous understandings on its subject matter.

15.2 Severability.
If any provision of this license is held unenforceable, the remaining
provisions remain in full force and effect, and the unenforceable
provision will be modified to the minimum extent necessary to make it
enforceable while preserving its intent.

15.3 No Waiver.
The Maintainers' failure or delay in enforcing a provision is not a waiver
of the right to enforce it later. A waiver must be in writing and signed
by all three Maintainers to be effective.

15.4 Assignment.
You may not assign or transfer Your rights or obligations under this
license without the prior written consent of the Maintainers; any
unauthorized assignment is void. The Maintainers, acting unanimously, may
assign this license in connection with a Permitted Transfer or a Major
Decision under Section 2.3.

15.5 Headings; Construction.
Section headings are for convenience only and do not affect interpretation.
This license has been drafted by all three Maintainers jointly; no rule of
construction against the drafter applies.

15.6 Notices.
Notice to OpenHours under this license must be sent to legal@openhours.me
and is deemed received by all three Maintainers when sent. Notice to You
may be sent to any address You have provided to OpenHours or, if none, by
posting in this repository.

